### Authentication API
# Execute as requisicoes na ordem: o cadastro e o login alimentam as variaveis usadas abaixo.
# Ao rodar via Aspire, ajuste @baseUrl para o endpoint exibido no dashboard.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@email = fulano@example.com
@password = Senha123

### Cadastrar usuario (publico)
# @name createUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Fulano de Tal",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "cpf": "529.982.247-25",
  "phone": "(11) 98765-4321",
  "birthDate": "1990-05-10",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Login (publico) - retorna o JWT
# Rate limiting: 5 tentativas por IP a cada 60s (padrao). Excedentes recebem 429 + Retry-After.
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

###
@userId = {{createUser.response.body.$.id}}
@token = {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Consultar usuario por Id
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar usuarios (paginado, com busca opcional por nome/e-mail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?page=1&pageSize=20&search=fulano
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Atualizar dados cadastrais (CPF e imutavel)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Fulano de Tal Silva",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "phone": "(11) 3333-4444",
  "birthDate": "1990-05-10"
}

### Trocar senha
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "{{password}}",
  "newPassword": "NovaSenha456"
}

### Excluir usuario (soft delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/heartbeat

### Health check (dependencias)
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthcheck

### Documento OpenAPI
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
